<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randgold Resources plans London listing.</title>
<headline>Randgold Resources plans London listing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd said on Monday its Randgold Resources unit would seek a listing on the London stock exchange in June.</p>
</text>
